2 0 obj
<<
/Producer (PyPDF2)
/Title (A\040DNA\055based\040molecular\040motor\040that\040can\040navigate\040a\040network\040of\040tracks)
/Author (Shelley\040F\056\040J\056\040Wickham\054\040Jonathan\040Bath\054\040Yousuke\040Katsuda\054\040Masayuki\040Endo\054\040Kumi\040Hidaka\054\040Hiroshi\040Sugiyama\054\040Andrew\040J\056\040Turberfield)
/Subject (Synthetic\040molecular\040motors\040can\040be\040fuelled\040by\040the\040hydrolysis\040or\040hybridization\040of\040DNA\056\040Such\040motors\040can\040move\040autonomously\040and\040programmably\054\040and\040long\055range\040transport\040has\040been\040observed\040on\040linear\040tracks\056\040It\040has\040also\040been\040shown\040that\040DNA\040systems\040can\040compute\056\040Here\054\040we\040report\040a\040synthetic\040DNA\055based\040system\040that\040integrates\040long\055range\040transport\040and\040information\040processing\056\040We\040show\040that\040the\040path\040of\040a\040motor\040through\040a\040network\040of\040tracks\040containing\040four\040possible\040routes\040can\040be\040programmed\040using\040instructions\040that\040are\040added\040externally\040or\040carried\040by\040the\040motor\040itself\056\040When\040external\040control\040is\040used\040we\040find\040that\04087\045\040of\040the\040motors\040follow\040the\040correct\040path\054\040and\040when\040internal\040control\040is\040used\04071\045\040of\040the\040motors\040follow\040the\040correct\040path\056\040Programmable\040motion\040will\040allow\040the\040development\040of\040computing\040networks\054\040molecular\040systems\040that\040can\040sort\040and\040process\040cargoes\040according\040to\040instructions\040that\040they\040carry\054\040and\040assembly\040lines\040that\040can\040be\040reconfigured\040dynamically\040in\040response\040to\040changing\040demands\056)
/Keywords (01\040Mar\0402012\054\040Nature\040Nanotechnology\054\040Molecular\040motor\054\040DNA\040walker\054\040University\040of\040Oxford\054\040Kyoto\040University)
>>
